{"4672790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Redline Contract", "steam_appid": 4672790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>You cover up the dirty secrets of the company you work for.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REDLINE CONTRACT is a 1–4 player co-op extraction FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You infiltrate Redline Corp’s classified facilities, complete your objectives, and if you’re good enough make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company defines you as an “asset.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are expendable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can be replaced instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY INFILTRATION IS UNPREDICTABLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No facility is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridors constantly shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies change positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hostage is never in the same place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot is different every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t memorize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptation is the only way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 OPERATION MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostage Rescue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You locate the hostage, gain their trust, and extract them safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As panic rises, control begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the hostage dies, the mission fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Recovery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stay silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the control room, initiate the data transfer, and hold your position until it completes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake locks everything down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You plant explosives at critical points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must extract before the countdown ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the final charge is placed, nothing is under control anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 STRIKES. NO SECOND CHANCE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team has only 3 total failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of strikes the operation ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is wiped</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything resets from zero</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redline Corp does not tolerate mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO CLASSES. YOU DON’T PICK A ROLE YOU EARN IT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All operators start equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a medkit -&gt; you become support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry C4 -&gt; you initiate the assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your equipment defines who you are</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is not chosen in a menu it’s forged in the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 player Steam co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedural facility generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 distinct operation modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment-driven organic role system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression and prestige system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared failure system — high risk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU MAKE MISTAKES. YOU PAY THE PRICE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You complete the mission…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or you never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>You cover up the dirty secrets of the company you work for.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REDLINE CONTRACT is a 1–4 player co-op extraction FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You infiltrate Redline Corp’s classified facilities, complete your objectives, and if you’re good enough make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company defines you as an “asset.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are expendable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can be replaced instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY INFILTRATION IS UNPREDICTABL