 team has only 3 total failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of strikes the operation ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is wiped</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything resets from zero</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redline Corp does not tolerate mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO CLASSES. YOU DON’T PICK A ROLE YOU EARN IT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All operators start equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a medkit -&gt; you become support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry C4 -&gt; you initiate the assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your equipment defines who you are</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is not chosen in a menu it’s forged in the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 player Steam co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedural facility generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 distinct operation modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment-driven organic role system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression and prestige system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared failure system — high risk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU MAKE MISTAKES. YOU PAY THE PRICE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You complete the mission…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or you never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "1–4 player co-op extraction FPS. Infiltrate Redline Corp’s hidden facilities, rescue hostages, and eliminate evidence or don’t make it out. Every map is procedural. Every run is different. Every mistake has a cost.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4672790/487f4cf8f30c75bba200ae16c987ad6731bc7071/header.jpg?t=1788100909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4672790/93017be46e972af10007fd4f625d32e8a4d51fab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788100909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4672790/93017be46e972af10007fd4f625d32e8a4d51fab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788100909", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Estimated performance: 1080p, Low sett